<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten stocks fell, three rose and seven were flat in a 9.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,573.2 points, 0.1 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units closed flat at 144.5 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
